msgstr "별도 장치"

#: ui/config/output_group.py:274
msgid ""
"<p>Channels of the main output's device: a controller's or an interface's"
" other output, played with the master. A device of its own: another "
"device (its clock followed, the master's sound kept: resampled by the "
"clocks' drift, a few hundred ppm at most).</p>"
